[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14160.63, "timestamp": "03:56:00", "text": "确切地。这就是我们在这里所做的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14162.389, "timestamp": "03:56:02", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14166.75, "timestamp": "03:56:06", "text": "啊，我把那件事做完了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14174.71, "timestamp": "03:56:14", "text": "欢迎回来。哦，我们确实得了分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14177.15, "timestamp": "03:56:17", "text": "是的。我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14180.55, "timestamp": "03:56:20", "text": "去。 60美元。我们走吧。哦，我是三级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14182.189, "timestamp": "03:56:22", "text": "我们开始吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14187.11, "timestamp": "03:56:27", "text": "去。哦，我拿到了镇静剂。我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14189.269, "timestamp": "03:56:29", "text": "哦，不错。你达到了五级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14191.51, "timestamp": "03:56:31", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14207.67, "timestamp": "03:56:47", "text": "我不庆幸自己没死。那么，这到底是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14211.189, "timestamp": "03:56:51", "text": "这些都是骷髅头的东西吗？所以米奇"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14214.15, "timestamp": "03:56:54", "text": "左边。呃，只有我们几个要去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14219.429, "timestamp": "03:56:59", "text": "玩。好的。哦，他走了。你好。"}]